WEBVTT

NOTE key=aa386f572ce95016

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.576
An old farmer had four sons who argued every day.

2
00:00:04.076 --> 00:00:07.884
One morning he asked them to bring him a bundle of sticks.

3
00:00:08.384 --> 00:00:11.263
He gave the whole bundle to the oldest son.

4
00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:15.409
"Break it," he said. The son tried, and could not.

5
00:00:15.909 --> 00:00:19.078
Each son tried. The bundle did not break.

6
00:00:19.578 --> 00:00:23.897
Then the farmer opened the bundle and gave each son one stick.

7
00:00:24.397 --> 00:00:25.593
"Now break it."

8
00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:27.962
Every stick broke easily.

9
00:00:28.462 --> 00:00:30.529
"You are the sticks," said the father.

10
00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:35.034
"Alone, anyone can break you. Together, nobody can."
